1:28:031 Stunde, 28 Minuten, 3 SekundenBecause if you understand the evolutionary function of empathy, something interesting happens to the way you think about its costs.
1:28:111 Stunde, 28 Minuten, 11 SekundenAnd the story of how empathy evolved is stranger and more layered than you might expect because it almost certainly
1:28:181 Stunde, 28 Minuten, 18 Sekundendidn't start with feelings at all. It started with something much simpler, something you can observe in species that we would never describe as
1:28:261 Stunde, 28 Minuten, 26 Sekundenemotionally sophisticated. And it has to do with the basic problem of raising offspring that can't take care of themselves.
1:28:341 Stunde, 28 Minuten, 34 SekundenThat's the puzzle. If you're a reptile, you lay your eggs and you leave. The hatchlings emerge. They're on their own and natural selection sorts the rest.
