1:29:021 Stunde, 29 Minuten, 2 SekundenAnd staying, it turns out, requires something that looks an awful lot like the earliest ancestor of what we now call empathy.
1:29:111 Stunde, 29 Minuten, 11 SekundenFrance Dval, the primatologist who spent decades studying social behavior in chimpanzees and bonobos, made this
1:29:181 Stunde, 29 Minuten, 18 Sekundenargument more carefully than almost anyone.
