1:29:291 Stunde, 29 Minuten, 29 Sekundennested layers. Each one built on top of a simpler, older one. And the innermost layer, the oldest one, is not a feeling
1:29:381 Stunde, 29 Minuten, 38 Sekundenat all. It's a capacity he called emotional contagion, which we've already talked about. That automatic tendency to
1:29:471 Stunde, 29 Minuten, 47 Sekundencatch the state of another organism. A rat hears another rat in distress and freezes.
