1:32:171 Stunde, 32 Minuten, 17 Sekundenby one. The top layer, the most recent one evolutionarily, is perspective taking. the ability to imagine what
1:32:251 Stunde, 32 Minuten, 25 Sekundenanother individual is experiencing even when you're not feeling it yourself.
