1:32:451 Stunde, 32 Minuten, 45 Sekundena handful of species seem to possess in any meaningful degree.
1:32:501 Stunde, 32 Minuten, 50 Sekundenhumans, great apes, possibly elephants, and citations. And that's roughly the list. So you've got these three layers.
1:32:591 Stunde, 32 Minuten, 59 SekundenContagion at the bottom, concern in the middle, perspective taking at the top.
