1:38:531 Stunde, 38 Minuten, 53 Sekundenthousands of small social interactions might in some cases not have fully assembled. Elaine Aaron herself noted
1:39:021 Stunde, 39 Minuten, 2 Sekundenthat sensory processing sensitivity interacts powerfully with early environment. That sensitive children
