1:41:001 Stunde, 41 Minutenregulatory capacity. And that gap can close not by becoming less sensitive but by
1:41:071 Stunde, 41 Minuten, 7 Sekundenbecoming more skilled. The same way a musician doesn't solve the problem of having exceptional hearing by wearing
