1:04:451 Stunde, 4 Minuten, 45 SekundenWhen you learn a second language later, often in a classroom, often through deliberate study, the emotional wiring
1:04:531 Stunde, 4 Minuten, 53 Sekundenis thinner. The words work. You understand them, but they don't vibrate in quite the same way.
1:05:021 Stunde, 5 Minuten, 2 SekundenAnd this has real consequences.
