1:05:321 Stunde, 5 Minuten, 32 SekundenThe deliberative system gets more room to operate.
1:05:361 Stunde, 5 Minuten, 36 SekundenYou're thinking through the same problem, but the cognitive infrastructure around it has shifted.
1:05:441 Stunde, 5 Minuten, 44 SekundenSome researchers have started calling this the emotional detachment effect of second language processing and it has
