1:46:061 Stunde, 46 Minuten, 6 Sekundencrossing the line. You only ever notice, if you notice at all, from the other side.
1:46:141 Stunde, 46 Minuten, 14 SekundenAnd this is worth sitting with for a moment because what your brain is doing right now or what it's preparing to do
1:46:221 Stunde, 46 Minuten, 22 Sekundenis not simply turning off. It's not powering down like a machine. It's performing one of the most complex
1:46:301 Stunde, 46 Minuten, 30 Sekundenattentional reorganizations in its entire repertoire. And it does it every single night. And it's been doing it
1:46:381 Stunde, 46 Minuten, 38 Sekundenevery night of your life. And you have almost no conscious memory of the process. itself.
1:46:441 Stunde, 46 Minuten, 44 SekundenYou remember being awake. You remember dreaming sometimes. But the crossing, the actual moment of transition, that's
