1:47:431 Stunde, 47 Minuten, 43 Sekundenstill arrives at the phalamus. The world is still sending signals, but the gate swings shut in pulses. And less and less
1:47:521 Stunde, 47 Minuten, 52 Sekundenof that information makes it through to the cortex. The outside world doesn't disappear all at once. It fades. It becomes intermittent.
1:48:021 Stunde, 48 Minuten, 2 SekundenSounds that would have grabbed your attention 5 minutes ago now wash past without registering.
