1:48:121 Stunde, 48 Minuten, 12 SekundenPausner's first system. The one driven by norepinephrine.
1:48:171 Stunde, 48 Minuten, 17 SekundenThe one that keeps you vigilant and responsive to the world. Quietly stepping down. Norepinephrine levels in
1:48:241 Stunde, 48 Minuten, 24 Sekundenthe locus coarius. That tiny brain stem nucleus that broadcasts alertness signals across the brain drop as you
1:48:331 Stunde, 48 Minuten, 33 Sekundenapproach sleep. They don't crash. They taper. And as they taper, the threshold
1:48:401 Stunde, 48 Minuten, 40 Sekundenfor what counts as worth noticing rises and rises.
